WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:18.000 --> 00:19.500
Chang Huan.

3
00:19.500 --> 00:21.091
We're here.

4
01:23.799 --> 01:28.473
[Apocalypse Log 13]

5
02:34.666 --> 02:36.466
Did you sleep well last night?

6
02:38.041 --> 02:39.341
Yeah.

7
02:57.250 --> 02:58.666
Not again.

8
02:58.666 --> 03:00.216
It's split open.

9
03:04.083 --> 03:05.458
I'm talking about your wound.

10
03:05.458 --> 03:07.216
What were you thinking?

11
03:09.166 --> 03:10.250
It's fine.

12
03:10.250 --> 03:11.416
It doesn't hurt anymore.

13
03:11.416 --> 03:13.175
The fever's gone, too.

14
03:23.125 --> 03:24.966
Let's focus on the task at hand.

15
03:25.916 --> 03:28.166
He Yao took the car.

16
03:28.166 --> 03:29.758
What do we do now?

17
03:30.375 --> 03:31.916
Follow the highway.

18
03:31.916 --> 03:34.091
We should be able to find a working car.

19
04:10.365 --> 04:11.999
Let's go.

20
04:35.541 --> 04:37.175
Watch your step.

21
04:47.583 --> 04:50.050
What's wrong? Did the wound open again?

22
04:54.166 --> 04:56.208
So childish.

23
04:56.208 --> 04:57.250
So what?

24
04:57.250 --> 04:58.633
What can do about it?

25
05:00.541 --> 05:02.216
You're such a child.

26
05:36.083 --> 05:37.208
This place...

27
05:37.208 --> 05:39.291
is actually quite well-preserved.

28
05:39.291 --> 05:40.501
Yeah.

29
05:40.501 --> 05:42.037
Let's take a break.

30
06:06.000 --> 06:08.208
For a split second there,

31
06:08.208 --> 06:10.675
I thought I was back before the apocalypse.

32
06:12.166 --> 06:14.083
It felt like...

33
06:14.083 --> 06:16.258
this was just a normal date.

34
06:18.041 --> 06:20.517
Did you use to come to places like this?

35
06:22.041 --> 06:26.098
Do you mean on a date, or to see a performance?

36
06:34.250 --> 06:35.916
This is my first date.

37
06:35.916 --> 06:38.716
I rarely came to live shows.

38
06:41.541 --> 06:43.591
Have you ever experienced this before?

39
06:49.541 --> 06:51.133
Let's eat first.

40
07:03.666 --> 07:05.383
You're so lazy.

41
07:15.125 --> 07:16.550
Here...

42
07:49.125 --> 07:50.500
It's okay.

43
07:50.500 --> 07:51.925
We're adequately far away.

44
08:30.500 --> 08:33.800
I didn't expect zombies to still have skills from when they were alive.

45
08:41.541 --> 08:42.791
Do you think...

46
08:42.791 --> 08:45.633
zombies might still have a shred of human consciousness left?

47
08:47.250 --> 08:49.175
Is it possible that one day,

48
08:50.583 --> 08:52.550
zombies could turn back into humans?

49
08:55.708 --> 08:57.508
It's just muscle memory.

50
08:58.458 --> 09:00.675
A zombie is a zombie.

51
09:01.416 --> 09:03.133
They can't turn back.

52
11:29.458 --> 11:31.175
Where are we?

53
11:35.041 --> 11:36.508
He Yao.

54
11:37.791 --> 11:40.017
What exactly are you trying to do?

55
11:43.333 --> 11:46.102
Stop feeding me these useless things.

56
11:48.958 --> 11:50.591
There's no going back.

57
11:52.208 --> 11:53.883
I know my own condition.

58
11:56.125 --> 11:57.666
I have a plan.

59
11:57.666 --> 11:59.208
Just give me some time.

60
11:59.208 --> 12:00.625
The equipment here may be old,

61
12:00.625 --> 12:01.667
but it's still functional.

62
12:01.667 --> 12:03.923
He Yao, you're always like this.

63
12:05.125 --> 12:08.216
Always acting like you're in total control.

64
12:09.041 --> 12:12.091
But when have you ever cared about what others think?

65
12:14.416 --> 12:16.383
Do you have any idea?

66
12:18.042 --> 12:20.467
The way you're acting now...

67
12:21.375 --> 12:24.925
is just like when you first barged into my life.

68
12:26.541 --> 12:27.958
Leave.

69
12:27.958 --> 12:29.426
Just get out of here.

70
12:29.426 --> 12:31.559
I don't want to see you.

71
12:49.750 --> 12:51.166
Yao Yao.

72
12:51.166 --> 12:54.193
This will be your home from now on.

73
12:54.193 --> 12:55.951
Don't be a stranger.

74
12:59.000 --> 13:01.417
Chang Huan is back.

75
13:01.417 --> 13:03.153
Come here.

76
13:03.153 --> 13:04.415
This is your brother, He Yao.

77
13:04.415 --> 13:05.706
You've met before.

78
13:05.706 --> 13:08.040
You remember him, right?

79
13:08.040 --> 13:11.048
He'll be living with us from now on.

80
13:15.665 --> 13:17.798
Yeah, I know.

81
13:18.706 --> 13:20.123
I'm going to my room.

82
13:20.123 --> 13:21.923
Your bed...

83
13:24.790 --> 13:27.631
Chang Huan is a bit shy around strangers.

84
15:39.748 --> 15:41.119
Mom.

85
15:42.206 --> 15:44.998
Chang Huan, you're back. Give that to me.

86
15:44.998 --> 15:47.415
What do you want to eat? I'll cook it.

87
15:47.415 --> 15:49.664
Today, I want to eat...

88
15:49.664 --> 15:51.415
Yao Yao.

89
15:51.415 --> 15:53.206
What happened to you?

90
15:53.206 --> 15:55.413
How did you cut your head?

91
15:55.413 --> 15:56.456
Come here and sit down.

92
15:56.456 --> 15:57.873
I'll clean the wound for you.

93
15:57.873 --> 15:58.998
It's okay, Auntie.

94
15:58.998 --> 16:00.331
I just fell by accident.

95
16:00.331 --> 16:02.631
But your head is bleeding.

96
16:03.998 --> 16:05.498
How did you manage to do this?

97
16:05.498 --> 16:07.206
How could you be so careless?

98
16:07.206 --> 16:08.881
I'm fine, Auntie.

99
16:10.040 --> 16:11.715
Let me dab it again.

100
16:12.331 --> 16:14.381
I'll be gentle.

101
16:16.040 --> 16:18.965
You're so careless. Let's use a new one.

102
16:24.748 --> 16:26.331
Your dad is working overtime.

103
16:26.331 --> 16:28.090
Let's eat first.

104
16:36.333 --> 16:38.204
Come on, eat more.

105
16:39.216 --> 16:40.849
Here.

106
16:43.415 --> 16:45.998
Today, Mr. Wang called me specifically

107
16:45.998 --> 16:47.665
to say that for the midterms,

108
16:47.665 --> 16:51.090
the top two in the grade are in our house.

109
16:51.915 --> 16:53.931
I'm so happy.

110
16:53.931 --> 16:57.081
Auntie, Chang Huan is the amazing one.

111
16:57.081 --> 16:58.748
For that tough math problem this time,

112
16:58.748 --> 17:00.206
his solution was very unique.

113
17:00.206 --> 17:02.298
Even the teacher didn't think of it.

114
17:03.290 --> 17:04.706
Really?

115
17:04.706 --> 17:06.748
You are both my pride and joy.

116
17:06.748 --> 17:11.548
Auntie, Chang Huan and I will keep up the good work.

117
17:13.958 --> 17:15.559
I'm full.

118
17:18.958 --> 17:22.392
This time, I didn't do well.

119
17:23.042 --> 17:25.717
Chang Huan! Chang Huan!

120
17:27.998 --> 17:30.173
What's wrong with this child?

121
18:30.123 --> 18:33.173
Do you want some water?

122
18:36.040 --> 18:37.540
Drinking too much water at night

123
18:37.540 --> 18:39.381
is bad for your kidneys.

124
19:00.290 --> 19:02.123
Still studying at this hour?

125
19:02.123 --> 19:05.250
Is it for the Math Olympiad?

126
19:05.250 --> 19:06.875
This problem of yours...

127
19:06.875 --> 19:08.675
I'll study on my own.

128
21:07.040 --> 21:09.048
Ever since we were kids,

129
21:10.164 --> 21:12.464
I've been trying my hardest,

130
21:13.665 --> 21:16.256
but I'm always one step behind you.

131
21:20.498 --> 21:22.456
He Yao.

132
21:22.456 --> 21:27.341
In your eyes, will I always need to be taken care of?

133
21:28.706 --> 21:30.831
You're my brother.

134
21:30.831 --> 21:32.248
Of course I have to take care of you.

135
21:32.248 --> 21:34.625
I'm not your brother.

136
21:34.625 --> 21:36.800
I am Sheng Chang Huan.

137
21:38.910 --> 21:40.997
I don't care what you think.

138
21:40.997 --> 21:43.715
You...

139
21:49.456 --> 21:52.000
Since we're tied together now,

140
21:52.000 --> 21:54.250
this path...

141
21:54.250 --> 21:56.458
we must walk it together.

142
21:56.458 --> 21:58.883
Leaving me is not an option.

143
21:59.917 --> 22:01.842
It never was.

144
22:23.706 --> 22:26.498
The inflammation in your wound is getting worse.

145
22:26.498 --> 22:28.465
We need to find some anti-inflammatory medicine soon.

146
22:31.290 --> 22:33.131
Rest for a bit.

147
22:41.790 --> 22:43.331
Wait here and don't move.

148
22:43.331 --> 22:45.667
I'll check if there's water in the well.

149
22:45.667 --> 22:47.425
Come back quickly.

150
23:00.665 --> 23:02.423
Why did you come over here?

151
23:03.167 --> 23:05.050
I wanted to keep an eye on you.

152
23:05.957 --> 23:08.049
I told you not to move.

153
23:16.833 --> 23:18.425
Don't move.

154
23:32.613 --> 23:34.205
Friends.

155
23:35.958 --> 23:38.008
Where are you two from?
